<div class="pd-g-feature-benefit aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">















	
	
	
	
	
	
	
		
	
		
	
	
	<div id="performance" class="st-feature-benefit       margin-top--48   padding-top--48  padding-bottom--0  bg-white  s-img-align-left  s-text-align-mo-center ">
		
		
			












	
	<div class="st-feature-benefit__wrap">
		
			
    
    
    
    
    
    
        <div class="st-feature-benefit__text-wrap">
            <div class="st-feature-benefit__text">
                
                <strong class="st-feature-benefit__eyebrow contrast-target">Performance</strong>
                <h3 class="st-feature-benefit__title contrast-target" data-font-size-pc="38" data-font-size-mo="26">For mobile gaming fans</h3>
                <div class="st-feature-benefit__desc-wrap">
                    
                    <p class="st-feature-benefit__desc contrast-target" data-font-size-pc="18" data-font-size-mo="14">As part of a raid or battling solo, the path to victory depends on your gear — and the Galaxy lineup has the power to keep you winning. The expansive, cinematic displays on both Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Z Fold7 give you a full view of the gameplay with all-day battery life to keep you gaming for hours on end. Our most powerful processor ever on Galaxy is customized to unlock Galaxy S26 Ultra's full potential, with a 24% boost to the GPU enabling improved ray tracing capabilities to handle the most demanding titles for regular mobile gamers. And with the re-engineered Vapor Chamber on Galaxy S26 Ultra efficiently defeating processing heat, you can play high-pressure, graphics-heavy games knowing your phone will keep its cool.<sup>1,2,3,4</sup></p>
                    
                    
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    
    

		
		
		
		
		<div class="st-feature-benefit__img-wrap  st-feature-benefit--video-autoplay">
			<div class="image image--dyn-height">
				
				
					<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f02_ft02_performance_pc_720x540.jpg?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f02_ft02_performance_mo_720x440.jpg?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="A man is playing a game on Galaxy S26 Ultra in Cobalt Violet while wearing Galaxy Buds4 Pro in White." data-mobile-alt="A man is playing a game on Galaxy S26 Ultra in Cobalt Violet while wearing Galaxy Buds4 Pro in White." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
					<img class="image__main lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f02_ft02_performance_pc_720x540.jpg?$720_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f02_ft02_performance_mo_720x440.jpg?$720_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="A man is playing a game on Galaxy S26 Ultra in Cobalt Violet while wearing Galaxy Buds4 Pro in White." data-mobile-alt="A man is playing a game on Galaxy S26 Ultra in Cobalt Violet while wearing Galaxy Buds4 Pro in White." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
				
			</div>
			
