						<div class="ft25-flip-card__figure">
							
							<div class="image">
								<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-vapor-chamber_pc_330x440.jpg?$330_440_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-vapor-chamber_mo_642x892.jpg?$642_892_JPG$" role="img" data-comp-name="image" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
								<img class="image__main lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-vapor-chamber_pc_330x440.jpg?$330_440_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-vapor-chamber_mo_642x892.jpg?$642_892_JPG$" role="img" data-comp-name="image" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
							</div>
						</div>
						
					</div>
					
					<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-inner ft25-flip-card__card-back">
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap">
							<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-inner">
								<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-area">
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__eyebrow-text">Vapor Chamber</div>
									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Play longer. Stay cooler</h4>
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">The Vapor Chamber inside Galaxy S26 Ultra has been redesigned to amplify gaming performance. Galaxy S26 Ultra's newly designed multi-channel configuration dissipates heat faster and more efficiently than before. Alongside the tailored thermal interface material (TIM), the advanced cooling system helps further absorb and disperse heat. So your phone stays cool, fast and responsive.<sup>1,5</sup></div>
									<button class="ft25-flip-card__icon-wrap" an-tr="ft25_flip card-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="flip card:vapor chamber:close" type="button">
