							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					
				</div>
				
				
				<div class="ft25-flip-card__card swiper-slide">
					<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-inner ft25-flip-card__card-front ft25-flip-card__card--contents-type-image" style="background:">
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap">
							<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-inner">
								<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-area">
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__eyebrow-text">Battery</div>
									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Ultra-fast charge. Ultra-long lasting</h4>
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<button class="ft25-flip-card__icon-wrap" an-tr="ft25_flip card-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="flip card:battery:plus" type="button">
								<span class="hidden">show more card open</span>
								<svg class="icon" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							</button>
							
						</div>
						
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__figure">
							
							<div class="image">
								<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-battery_pc_330x440.jpg?$330_440_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-battery_mo_642x892.jpg?$642_892_JPG$" role="img" data-comp-name="image" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
								<img class="image__main lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-battery_pc_330x440.jpg?$330_440_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-battery_mo_642x892.jpg?$642_892_JPG$" role="img" data-comp-name="image" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
							</div>
						</div>
						
					</div>
					
					<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-inner ft25-flip-card__card-back">
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap">
							<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-inner">
								<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-area">
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__eyebrow-text">Battery</div>
									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Ultra-fast charge. Ultra-long lasting</h4>
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">Galaxy smartphones let you game on for hours without pressing pause. Thanks to the AP's software optimization, Galaxy S26 Ultra's 5000 mAh battery offers up to 31 hours of video playback. And it supports Super Fast Charging 3.0, engineered to refuel your device up to 75% in around 30 minutes. Or use the Magnet Wireless Charger to harness Super Fast Wireless Charging.<sup>1,6,7,8</sup></div>
									<button class="ft25-flip-card__icon-wrap" an-tr="ft25_flip card-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="flip card:battery:close" type="button">
										<span class="hidden">show more card open</span>
										<svg class="icon" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#delete-bold" href="#delete-bold"></use></svg>
									</button>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					
				</div>
				
				
				<div class="ft25-flip-card__card swiper-slide">
					<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-inner ft25-flip-card__card-front ft25-flip-card__card--contents-type-image" style="background:">
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap">
							<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-inner">
								<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-area">
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__eyebrow-text">Ray Tracing</div>
									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Game graphics brought to life</h4>
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<button class="ft25-flip-card__icon-wrap" an-tr="ft25_flip card-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="flip card:ray tracing:plus" type="button">
								<span class="hidden">show more card open</span>
								<svg class="icon" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							</button>
							
						</div>
						
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__figure">
							
							<div class="image">
								<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-ray-tracing_pc_330x440.jpg?$330_440_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-ray-tracing_mo_642x892.jpg?$642_892_JPG$" role="img" data-comp-name="image" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
								<img class="image__main lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-ray-tracing_pc_330x440.jpg?$330_440_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f03_ft25_performance-ray-tracing_mo_642x892.jpg?$642_892_JPG$" role="img" data-comp-name="image" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
							</div>
						</div>
						
					</div>
					
					<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-inner ft25-flip-card__card-back">
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap">
							<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-inner">
								<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-area">
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__eyebrow-text">Ray Tracing</div>
									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Game graphics brought to life</h4>
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">The powerful custom processor inside Galaxy S26 Ultra features GPU and CPU improvements that enable greater ray tracing performance. Game graphics seem more 3D and true-to-life with realistic colors and light creating dynamic shadows and reflections. The phone also integrates the graphics API Vulkan to enhance seamless loading and promote stable gameplay, for lifelike scenes that load in real time.<sup>3,4</sup></div>
									<button class="ft25-flip-card__icon-wrap" an-tr="ft25_flip card-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="flip card:ray tracing:close" type="button">
