<div class="pd-g-feature-benefit aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">















	
	
	
	
	
	
	
		
	
		
	
	
	<div id="camera" class="st-feature-benefit       margin-top--48   padding-top--0  padding-bottom--0  bg-white  s-img-align-left  s-text-align-mo-center ">
		
		
			












	
	<div class="st-feature-benefit__wrap">
		
			
    
    
    
    
    
    
        <div class="st-feature-benefit__text-wrap">
            <div class="st-feature-benefit__text">
                
                <strong class="st-feature-benefit__eyebrow contrast-target">Camera</strong>
                <h3 class="st-feature-benefit__title contrast-target" data-font-size-pc="38" data-font-size-mo="26">For the everyday photographer<br /></h3>
                <div class="st-feature-benefit__desc-wrap">
                    
                    <p class="st-feature-benefit__desc contrast-target" data-font-size-pc="18" data-font-size-mo="14">Whether you prefer to be behind the camera or in front of it, you'll find a Galaxy camera that suits you. For candids and portraiture, Pro Mode gives you full control of Galaxy S26 Ultra's powerful camera system — including the wider and brighter apertures — so you can make manual adjustments and push your creativity to the limits. Or open in the Expert RAW app to save RAW files that allow you to dial in the editing to get the photo exactly how you pictured it. And when you want to be the star of your portraits, Galaxy Z Flip7 and its unique FlexCam let you set up and shoot, hands-free.<br /><br />If you're into video creation, enable Pro Video Mode to tweak and set the scene how you envisioned it, making full use of the wider apertures on Galaxy S26 Ultra if you're shooting in low light. Add in Nightography, delivering noise reduction enabled by the advanced processor, and you'll pull details out of the dark and capture them with clarity.<sup>1,9</sup></p>
                    
                    
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    
    

		
		
		
		
		<div class="st-feature-benefit__img-wrap  st-feature-benefit--video-autoplay">
			<div class="image image--dyn-height">
				
				
					<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f04_ft02_camera_pc_720x540.jpg?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f04_ft02_camera_mo_720x440.jpg?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="A photo of a landscape against a night sky, clear and full of detail thanks to the improved low-light function on the 200 MP Wide camera on Galaxy S26 Ultra." data-mobile-alt="A photo of a landscape against a night sky, clear and full of detail thanks to the improved low-light function on the 200 MP Wide camera on Galaxy S26 Ultra." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
					<img class="image__main lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f04_ft02_camera_pc_720x540.jpg?$720_N_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f04_ft02_camera_mo_720x440.jpg?$720_N_JPG$" data-desktop-alt="A photo of a landscape against a night sky, clear and full of detail thanks to the improved low-light function on the 200 MP Wide camera on Galaxy S26 Ultra." data-mobile-alt="A photo of a landscape against a night sky, clear and full of detail thanks to the improved low-light function on the 200 MP Wide camera on Galaxy S26 Ultra." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
				
			</div>
			
