						<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap">
							<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-inner">
								<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-area">
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__eyebrow-text">Professional Photography</div>
									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Shot to edit, you&#39;re the pro</h4>
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">Activate Pro Mode in the Camera app for greater in-camera control. Manual camera functions allow you to tweak things like ISO, shutter speed, white balance, exposure and focus. Or, use Expert RAW to shoot in RAW for more detailed editing abilities in post. Pro Mode and Expert RAW ensure you can make the most of Galaxy's most powerful camera system and get the shot just how you want it.<sup>1,9</sup></div>
									<button class="ft25-flip-card__icon-wrap" an-tr="ft25_flip card-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="flip card:professional photography:close" type="button">
