						<div class="ft25-flip-card__figure">
							
							<div class="image">
								<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f05_ft25_camera-nightography-video_pc_330x440.jpg?$330_440_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f05_ft25_camera-nightography-video_mo_642x892.jpg?$642_892_JPG$" role="img" data-comp-name="image" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
								<img class="image__main lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f05_ft25_camera-nightography-video_pc_330x440.jpg?$330_440_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/find_your_galaxy/find-your-galaxy_f05_ft25_camera-nightography-video_mo_642x892.jpg?$642_892_JPG$" role="img" data-comp-name="image" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
							</div>
						</div>
						
					</div>
					
					<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-inner ft25-flip-card__card-back">
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap">
							<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-inner">
								<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-area">
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__eyebrow-text">Nightography Video</div>
									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">More light, less noise</h4>
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">Wider apertures and enhanced processing on Galaxy S26 Ultra's camera deliver superior low-light videos. The Wide camera opens to F1.4, 47% brighter than the previous F1.7, and the Telephoto Camera with 10x optical quality zoom has F2.9 for bright shots even when zoomed in. Tap the shutter, and Nightography Video helps reduce noise and clear up the view, resulting in vibrant colors and detailed clarity.<sup>1,9,10,11</sup></div>
									<button class="ft25-flip-card__icon-wrap" an-tr="ft25_flip card-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="flip card:nightography video:close" type="button">
										<span class="hidden">show more card open</span>
										<svg class="icon" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#delete-bold" href="#delete-bold"></use></svg>
									</button>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					
				</div>
				
				
				<div class="ft25-flip-card__card swiper-slide">
					<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-inner ft25-flip-card__card-front ft25-flip-card__card--contents-type-image" style="background:">
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap">
							<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-inner">
								<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-area">
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__eyebrow-text">FlexCam</div>
									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Flexible camera for new angles</h4>
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<button class="ft25-flip-card__icon-wrap" an-tr="ft25_flip card-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="flip card:flexcam:plus" type="button">
								<span class="hidden">show more card open</span>
								<svg class="icon" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							</button>
							
						</div>
						
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__figure">
							
							<div class="image">
								<img class="image__preview lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/find-your-galaxy_f05_ft25_camera-flexcam_pc_330x440.jpg?$330_440_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/find-your-galaxy_f05_ft25_camera-flexcam_mo_642x892.jpg?$642_892_JPG$" role="img" data-comp-name="image" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
								<img class="image__main lazy-load responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/find-your-galaxy_f05_ft25_camera-flexcam_pc_330x440.jpg?$330_440_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/find-your-galaxy_f05_ft25_camera-flexcam_mo_642x892.jpg?$642_892_JPG$" role="img" data-comp-name="image" data-aem-asset-id=""/>
							</div>
						</div>
						
					</div>
					
					<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-inner ft25-flip-card__card-back">
						<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap">
							<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-inner">
								<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-area">
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__eyebrow-text">FlexCam</div>
									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Flexible camera for new angles</h4>
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">With its unique form factor and 50 MP Wide camera, Galaxy Z Flip7's FlexCam takes selfies to new heights. Choose your angle, set it down and the phone will hold its pose. Preview your shot on the expanded FlexWindow and use Galaxy Watch to press the shutter. Then the high-resolution sensor and ProVisual Engine work together to capture natural skin textures and tones.<sup>1,9,12</sup></div>
