	<div id="music" class="st-feature-benefit       margin-top--48   padding-top--0  padding-bottom--0  bg-white  s-img-align-left  s-text-align-mo-center ">
		
		
			












	
	<div class="st-feature-benefit__wrap">
		
			
    
    
    
    
    
    
        <div class="st-feature-benefit__text-wrap">
            <div class="st-feature-benefit__text">
                
                <strong class="st-feature-benefit__eyebrow contrast-target">Music</strong>
                <h3 class="st-feature-benefit__title contrast-target" data-font-size-pc="38" data-font-size-mo="26">For true music fans</h3>
                <div class="st-feature-benefit__desc-wrap">
                    
                    <p class="st-feature-benefit__desc contrast-target" data-font-size-pc="18" data-font-size-mo="14">If you love to listen, you want the pitch-perfect duo of Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Buds4 Pro. Surround yourself in the full-spectrum 24-bit / 96 kHz sound delivered with their effortless connection. Once connected, controls appear on your phone for you to seamlessly and quickly fine-tune what you're hearing and even make individual adjustments specific to each streaming app. And you're enveloped in rich, ultra high-quality audio that intelligently adapts to your ears and your surroundings, creating a natural, balanced listening experience that's tailored to you while staying true to the original recording.<sup>1,13</sup></p>
                    
                    
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    
    

		
		
		
		
