						<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap">
							<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-inner">
								<div class="ft25-flip-card__text-wrap-area">
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__eyebrow-text">Hi-Fi Duet</div>
									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">A fine-tuned Hi-Fi connection</h4>
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">With the Samsung Seamless Codec, Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Buds4 Pro are truly made for each other. Galaxy S26 Ultra delivers Ultra high-quality 24-bit / 96 kHz SSC-UHQ audio to Galaxy Buds for clarity and detail that sound like you're in the studio. And this high-performing pair allows you to use AI assistance or address notifications on your phone without ever touching the screen.<sup>1,13,24</sup></div>
									<button class="ft25-flip-card__icon-wrap" an-tr="ft25_flip card-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="flip card:hi fi duet:close" type="button">
