									<h4 class="ft25-flip-card__title">Noise cancelation adapted to you</h4>
									<div class="ft25-flip-card__card-description">Control the noise with intelligent earbuds that can shift to suit how you wear them. Adaptive ANC optimizes ANC performance through an enhanced algorithm that adapts to your ear shape to figure out how much sound is leaking. You can experience deeper immersion in the vivid and clear Hi-Fi audio — distractions fade in real time, leaving behind only deeply engaging sound.<sup>1</sup></div>
									<button class="ft25-flip-card__icon-wrap" an-tr="ft25_flip card-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="flip card:adaptive anc:close" type="button">
