	<div class="textblock    bg-white  text-center  text-mo-center container-width-medium">
		
		
    	
    	
    	
    	<div class="textblock__body padding-top--48 padding-bottom--48">
				
				
			<h2 class="textblock__title" data-font-size-pc="38" data-font-size-mo="26">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
			
			
			
			
			
			
			
		</div>
	</div>
	

</div>
<div class="su-g-accordion-faqs aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">













<div class="ab-g-list-exp section">
	<ul class="su12-accordion-faqs  " role="list">
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item on" an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:what should i consider when buying a new mobile phone" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="true" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">What should I consider when buying a new mobile phone?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id03">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">When you're in the market for a new phone there are some key specifications to consider to ensure that it suits your needs and your lifestyle.
<br />
<br />• Think about whether you want a standard smartphone style or if you would prefer a foldable form factor. For the former type, the S Series phones will be a good option. For the latter type, check out Galaxy Z Fold7.
<br />
<br />• If you love to take photos and video, you'll want the best camera a Samsung Galaxy phone can provide. Galaxy S26 Ultra offers the most advanced camera system on any Galaxy smartphone with the high-resolution 200 MP sensor and wider apertures making it the brightest camera yet.<sup>9,11</sup>
<br />
<br />• If you're a gamer, high performance is what you need to consider. Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Z Fold7 are equipped with hardware and software to keep gameplay fast and clear, like the most powerful processor customized for Galaxy as well as innovative Vapor Chamber technology to keep the phone cool.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:im thinking about upgrading which galaxy is best for everyday use" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">I&#39;m thinking about upgrading, which Galaxy is best for everyday use?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id171">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">If you're looking for the best Samsung Galaxy phone to buy, consider Galaxy S26 Ultra, a Galaxy smartphone that seamlessly fits into your lifestyle and everyday use.
<br />
<br />• With the 200 MP high-resolution camera, wider apertures and AI enhancements for clear photos and videos even in low light, the camera system on Galaxy S26 Ultra is currently the best camera on a Samsung Galaxy phone.<sup>9</sup>
<br />
<br />• The next generation of the Snapdragon® processor, customized for Galaxy, delivers a fast and seamless experience even when you're playing graphics-heavy games. The CPU, GPU and NPU have all been improved to run software faster than ever before.<sup>2,3</sup></div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:im a fan of mobile games which galaxy device is good for gaming" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">I&#39;m a fan of mobile games, which Galaxy device is good for gaming?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id256">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">With powerful processors and the innovative Vapor Chamber cooling system, the gaming experience on Galaxy is cool, fast and ready for victory.
<br />
<br />• Galaxy S26 Ultra comes equipped with the next-gen 3 nm processor, Snapdragon® 8 Elite Gen 5 for Galaxy. It has been improved across CPU, GPU and NPU and also includes Galaxy's unique IP, like ProScaler and mobile Digital Natural Image engine (mDNIe), for greater processing efficiency that helps preserve battery life without compromising the view.<sup>2,3</sup>
<br />
<br />• To suit Galaxy S26 Ultra's slim design, we've reconfigured the Vapor Chamber for a 21% performance improvement, enabling you to use your device more comfortably and for longer.<sup>5</sup>
<br />
<br />• The GPU and CPU improvements in our next-gen processor enable up to 20% improvement in ray tracing performance on Galaxy S26 Ultra for a more engaging mobile gaming experience. In addition, graphics are optimized by Vulkan to further accelerate ray tracing, enhance seamless loading and promote stable gameplay.<sup>4</sup></div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:if i play a lot of videos and games how long do galaxy smartphone batteries last" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">If I play a lot of videos and games, how long do Galaxy smartphone batteries last?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id35">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">Galaxy smartphones come with large battery capacity and software optimization that helps ensure the longest battery life.
<br />
<br />• Galaxy S26 Ultra has the highest battery capacity of the Galaxy S Series with 5000 mAh. This is equivalent to 31 hours of video playback time.<sup>6,7,8</sup>
<br />
<br />• With the ability to use Super Fast Charging 3.0, you can charge back up to 75% in around 30 minutes.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:i love making content which galaxy has the best camera" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">I love making content, which Galaxy has the best camera?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id425">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">Content creators need a powerful tool to make everything from shoot to edits feel easy, and Galaxy S26 Ultra is exactly that tool.
<br />
<br />• It's got the best camera currently available on a Samsung Galaxy phone with its 200 MP high-resolution Wide camera.
<br />
<br />• The camera system includes 10 MP 3x Telephoto and 50 MP 10x Optical Quality Telephoto cameras and a 50 MP Ultra Wide camera for macro and landscape shots. The 200 MP Wide and 50 MP 10x Optical Quality Telephoto cameras also have wider apertures that pull in more light to take brighter photos and videos in low light.<sup>9,10</sup>
<br />
<br />• The advanced processor enhances the low-light video performance even further by enabling Nightography. It detects the characteristics of each camera's sensor and delivers optimized noise reduction.
<br />
<br />• You can zoom further without taking a step with 3x and 5x optical zoom as well as 2x and 10x optical quality zoom. The camera can then zoom up to 100x digital Space Zoom. The 50 MP Telephoto camera, which has 5x optical zoom and 10x optical quality zoom, also features an F2.9 aperture that is 37% brighter than Galaxy S25 Ultra.<sup>20</sup></div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:music is my life how is the audio quality on galaxy devices" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">Music is my life, how is the audio quality on Galaxy devices?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id545">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">The Hi-Fi duet of Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Buds4 Pro gives audiophiles the opportunity to take studio-quality sound anywhere they go.
<br />
<br />• The 24-bit / 96 kHz Samsung Seamless Codec, available on both Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Buds4 Pro, delivers Hi-Fi audio while preserving clarity and fine details.<sup>13</sup>
<br />
<br />• When connected to a Galaxy device, you can enable 360 Audio on your Galaxy Buds4 Pro to experience truly surround sound that shifts with your movements.
<br />
<br />• Powerful ANC and Adaptive ANC help you be deeply immersed in sound, keeping your listening experience free of interruption and distractions.
<br />
<br />• The connection between Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Buds4 Pro is effortless and near-instant, letting you connect with a tap instead of having to download another app. Once connected, you can control your Galaxy Buds4 Pro by swiping down on Galaxy S26 Ultra's display to bring out the Quick Panel.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:what galaxy devices do i need to track my health" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">What Galaxy devices do I need to track my health?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id60">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">Keeping track of your health and wellness goals on the Samsung Health app is simple with the Galaxy ecosystem, including devices like Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Watch.
<br />
<br />• The Samsung Health app on Galaxy S26 Ultra delivers in-depth insights for things like sleep, exercise, nutrition, heart health and more. 
<br />
<br />• When paired with Galaxy S26 Ultra, Galaxy Watch gets to know your body and your routine, analyzing your sleep and workouts to create personalized plans that help you make informed decisions about your health.
<br />
<br />• Galaxy devices also help monitor sleep patterns, activities and heart rate throughout the week for wellness insights like your Energy Score.<sup>18</sup>
<br />
<br />• When Samsung Galaxy devices are connected, they seamlessly work together to give you comprehensive analytics and suggestions to help ensure you feel your best all day, every day.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:what are the benefits of buying from samsung com" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">What are the benefits of buying from Samsung.com?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id730">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">Buying directly from Samsung.com gives you peace of mind about receiving an authentic Samsung product as well as other benefits.
<br />
<br />• You'll get access to exclusive color options found only on Samsung.com.
<br />
<br />• You can also ask questions and receive guidance from our online support team. They can assist you every step of the process, from item selection to checkout for a smooth, worry-free experience. 
<br />
<br />• You can also check out our special deals and events, some of which are available only online, and find ways to get your device at a better value.
<br />
<br />• When you are ready to make a purchase online, you can earn Samsung Rewards and also receive free delivery.
<br />
<br />• All products purchased from Samsung.com also come with an official Samsung warranty to help you feel secure as you use your new device.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:can i transfer my data from ios" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">Can I transfer my data from iOS?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id875">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">Yes, Smart Switch makes it easy to move your data from iOS to Galaxy devices including smartphones and tablets.
<br />
<br />• Contacts, photos, videos, notes and calendar events can all be transferred seamlessly.
<br />
<br />• Our Smart Switch app lets you connect your new device to your old device wirelessly or use a cable for faster transfer.<sup>21,22,23</sup>
<br />
<br />• The simple setup process means you can start using your new Galaxy device with your previous data right away.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
			
			
			<li class="su12-accordion-faqs__item " an-tr="su12_accordion faqs-product recommendation-cta-content_click" an-ca="content click" an-ac="feature" an-la="faq:accordion:can i trade in my device for a galaxy device" role="listitem">
				<h3>
					<a href="javascript:void(0)" class="su12-accordion-faqs__title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
						
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__title-text">Can I trade in my device for a Galaxy device?</div>
						<span class="icon-wrap">
							<svg class="icon plus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#plus-bold" href="#plus-bold"></use></svg>
							<svg class="icon minus" focusable="false"><use xlink:href="#minus-bold" href="#minus-bold"></use></svg>
						</span>
					</a>
				</h3>
				<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents" id="anchor-id99">
					<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-description">Samsung makes trading in your old devices for credit when you purchase a new Galaxy device.<sup>19</sup>
<br />
<br />• To begin, all you need to do is answer a few questions online and you can find out what your device is worth, immediately. 
<br />
<br />• You'll get instant discount for the Trade-In value of your device. 
<br />
<br />• There are few restrictions, and Samsung will accept your old device even if your screen is cracked or it's not a Samsung device.</div>
					
					
						
					<!--
						<div class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer-wrap">
							<p class="su12-accordion-faqs__contents-disclaimer">...omitted...</p>
						</div>-->
						
					

					
				</div>
			</li>
		
	</ul>
</div>

