ocessor, customized for Galaxy, delivers a fast and seamless experience even when you're playing graphics-heavy games. The CPU, GPU and NPU have all been improved to run software faster than ever before.<sup>2,3</sup>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"I'm a fan of mobile games, which Galaxy device is good for gaming?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"With powerful processors and the innovative Vapor Chamber cooling system, the gaming experience on Galaxy is cool, fast and ready for victory.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• Galaxy S26 Ultra comes equipped with the next-gen 3 nm processor, Snapdragon® 8 Elite Gen 5 for Galaxy. It has been improved across CPU, GPU and NPU and also includes Galaxy's unique IP, like ProScaler and mobile Digital Natural Image engine (mDNIe), for greater processing efficiency that helps preserve battery life without compromising the view.<sup>2,3</sup>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• To suit Galaxy S26 Ultra's slim design, we've reconfigured the Vapor Chamber for a 21% performance improvement, enabling you to use your device more comfortably and for longer.<sup>5</sup>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• The GPU and CPU improvements in our next-gen processor enable up to 20% improvement in ray tracing performance on Galaxy S26 Ultra for a more engaging mobile gaming experience. In addition, graphics are optimized by Vulkan to further accelerate ray tracing, enhance seamless loading and promote stable gameplay.<sup>4</sup>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"If I play a lot of videos and games, how long do Galaxy smartphone batteries last?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Galaxy smartphones come with large battery capacity and software optimization that helps ensure the longest battery life.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• Galaxy S26 Ultra has the highest battery capacity of the Galaxy S Series with 5000 mAh. This is equivalent to 31 hours of video playback time.<sup>6,7,8</sup>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• With the ability to use Super Fast Charging 3.0, you can charge back up to 75% in around 30 minutes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"I love making content, which Galaxy has the best camera?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Content creators need a powerful tool to make everything from shoot to edits feel easy, and Galaxy S26 Ultra is exactly that tool.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• It's got the best camera currently available on a Samsung Galaxy phone with its 200 MP high-resolution Wide camera.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• The camera system includes 10 MP 3x Telephoto and 50 MP 10x Optical Quality Telephoto cameras and a 50 MP Ultra Wide camera for macro and landscape shots. The 200 MP Wide and 50 MP 10x Optical Quality Telephoto cameras also have wider apertures that pull in more light to take brighter photos and videos in low light.<sup>9,10</sup>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• The advanced processor enhances the low-light video performance even further by enabling Nightography. It detects the characteristics of each camera's sensor and delivers optimized noise reduction.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• You can zoom further without taking a step with 3x and 5x optical zoom as well as 2x and 10x optical quality zoom. The camera can then zoom up to 100x digital Space Zoom. The 50 MP Telephoto camera, which has 5x optical zoom and 10x optical quality zoom, also features an F2.9 aperture that is 37% brighter than Galaxy S25 Ultra.<sup>20</sup>"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Music is my life, how is the audio quality on Galaxy devices?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Hi-Fi duet of Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Buds4 Pro gives audiophiles the opportunity to take studio-quality sound anywhere they go.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• The 24-bit / 96 kHz Samsung Seamless Codec, available on both Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Buds4 Pro, delivers Hi-Fi audio while preserving clarity and fine details.<sup>13</sup>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• When connected to a Galaxy device, you can enable 360 Audio on your Galaxy Buds4 Pro to experience truly surround sound that shifts with your movements.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• Powerful ANC and Adaptive ANC help you be deeply immersed in sound, keeping your listening experience free of interruption and distractions.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• The connection between Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Buds4 Pro is effortless and near-instant, letting you connect with a tap instead of having to download another app. Once connected, you can control your Galaxy Buds4 Pro by swiping down on Galaxy S26 Ultra's display to bring out the Quick Panel."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Galaxy devices do I need to track my health?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Keeping track of your health and wellness goals on the Samsung Health app is simple with the Galaxy ecosystem, including devices like Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Watch.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• The Samsung Health app on Galaxy S26 Ultra delivers in-depth insights for things like sleep, exercise, nutrition, heart health and more. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>• When paired with Galaxy S26 Ultra, Galaxy Watch gets to know your body and your routine, analyzing your sleep and workouts to create personalized plans that help you make informed decisions about your health.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• Galaxy devices also help monitor sleep patterns, activities and heart rate throughout the week for wellness insights like your Energy Score.<sup>18</sup>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• When Samsung Galaxy devices are connected, they seamlessly work together to give you comprehensive analytics and suggestions to help ensure you feel your best all day, every day."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the benefits of buying from Samsung.com?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Buying directly from Samsung.com gives you peace of mind about receiving an authentic Samsung product as well as other benefits.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• You'll get access to exclusive color options found only on Samsung.com.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• You can also ask questions and receive guidance from our online support team. They can assist you every step of the process, from item selection to checkout for a smooth, worry-free experience. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>• You can also check out our special deals and events, some of which are available only online, and find ways to get your device at a better value.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• When you are ready to make a purchase online, you can earn Samsung Rewards and also receive free delivery.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• All products purchased from Samsung.com also come with an official Samsung warranty to help you feel secure as you use your new device."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I transfer my data from iOS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Smart Switch makes it easy to move your data from iOS to Galaxy devices including smartphones and tablets.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• Contacts, photos, videos, notes and calendar events can all be transferred seamlessly.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• Our Smart Switch app lets you connect your new device to your old device wirelessly or use a cable for faster transfer.<sup>21,22,23</sup>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• The simple setup process means you can start using your new Galaxy device with your previous data right away."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I trade in my device for a Galaxy device?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Samsung makes trading in your old devices for credit when you purchase a new Galaxy device.<sup>19</sup>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>• To begin, all you need to do is answer a few questions online and you can find out what your device is worth, immediately. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>• You'll get instant discount for the Trade-In value of your device. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>• There are few restrictions, and Samsung will accept your old device even if your screen is cracked or it's not a Samsung device."}}]}</script>


</div>
<div class="cm-g-text-editor aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">







	<!-- [Dialog] Page Type: Common -->
	
		<div class="text-editor    bg-light-gray">
			<div class="text-editor__inner-wrap padding-top--48 padding-bottom--48">
				<div class="text-editor__inner  desktop-padding-left-right--large mobile-padding-left-right--small  ">
					
						<div class="text-editor__column-wrap">
							
							<div class="text-editor__column description-text-size--small">
								<p>1. Images simulated for illustrative purposes.</p>
<p>2. Snapdragon branded products are products of Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. and/or its subsidiaries. Snapdragon is a trademark or registered trademark of Qualcomm Incorporated.</p>
<p>3. AP performance improvements shown compared to Galaxy S25 Ultra. Actual performance will depend on user environment, conditions and pre-installed software and applications.</p>
<p>4. Ray tracing is supported on Galaxy S26 devices. Availability may vary by device, content and application.</p>
<p>5. Vapor Chamber performance improvements shown compared to Galaxy S25 Ultra. Actual performance will depend on user environment, conditions and pre-installed software and applications.</p>
<p>6. Actual battery life varies by network environment, features and apps used, frequency of calls and messages, the number of times charged, and many other factors. Estimated against the average usage profile compiled by UX Connect Research. Independently assessed by UX Connect Research between 2026.1.8-2026.1.30 in US and UK with pre-release versions of SM-S948 under default setting using LTE and 5G Sub6 networks. NOT tested under 5G mmWave network.</p>
<p>7. Based on Samsung internal lab test conditions with pre-release version of given model connected to earphone via Bluetooth under default settings over LTE. Estimated against battery capacity and measured current over battery power consumption during video playback (video file resolution 720 p, saved on device) on the main screen. Actual video playback time may vary by network connection, settings, video file format, screen brightness, battery condition and many other factors.</p>
<p>8. Typical value tested under third-party laboratory condition. Typical value is the estimated average value considering the deviation in battery capacity among the battery samples tested under IEC 61960 standard. Rated capacity is 4855 mAh for Galaxy S26 Ultra.</p>
<p>9. Results may vary depending on light condition and/or shooting conditions including multiple subjects, being out of focus or moving subjects.</p>
<p>10. Optical quality zoom on Galaxy S26 Ultra is enabled by the Adaptive Pixel sensor. 10x distance is optical quality zoom.</p>
<p>11. Brightness improvements shown compared to Galaxy S25 Ultra.</p>
<p>12. 50 MP resolution is available on Galaxy Z Flip7's rear wide camera only.</p>
<p>13. Ultra High Quality Audio up to 24-bit / 96 kHz is available on Galaxy S26 series, S25 series, S24 series, S23 series, Z Fold7, Z Flip7, Z Fold6, Z Flip6, Z Fold5, Z Flip5 and Tab S11 series, Tab S10 series, Tab S9 series with One UI 6.1.1 or above. Additional devices may be supported in the future.</p>
<p>14. Availability of functions may vary by country, language, device model, apps. Some functional widgets may require a network connection and/or Samsung Account login. Available on Samsung Galaxy devices with One UI 8.0 or above. Additional devices may be supported in the future.</p>
<p>15. Bedtime Guidance is available on Android phones (Android 11 and above) and requires Samsung Health app (v6.30.2 or later). Bedtime Guidance based on 3 consecutive days of sleep analysis of user's circadian rhythm and sleep pressure. Intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. The measurements are for your personal reference only. Not intended for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or sleep disorder. Please consult a medical professional for advice.</p>
<p>16. Sleep Coaching is available on Galaxy Watch4 Series and above. Sleep Coaching requires Samsung Health application version 6.24 or later. Samsung Account login required. Sleep Coaching requires sleep data of at least 7 days, including at least 1 work day and 1 day off. Intended for general wellness and fitness purposes only. The measurements are for your personal reference only. Not intended for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition or sleep disorder. Please consult a medical professional for advice.</p>
<p>17. Running Coach program is available on Android phones (Android 10 or above) and requires Samsung Health app (v6.30.2 or above). Samsung Account login required. Service only available with Galaxy Watch7 Series or later released Galaxy Watch Series. To use Running Coach program, user needs to take a running level test and get a level before starting the coach program.</p>
<p>18. Energy Score is available on Android phones (Android 11 or above) and requires Samsung Health app (v6.27 or above). Samsung Account login required. Service availability may vary by country, region, language. To check the Energy Score, the health data tracked from Samsung Galaxy Watch must be synchronized with the Samsung Health app. Needs at least the previous day's activity data and sleep, and heart rate data during sleep. Not intended for use in detection, diagnosis, treatment of any medical condition. The result is for your personal reference only. Please consult a medical professional for advice.</p>
<p>19. To be eligible for trade-in, your qualifying device must meet all Trade-In Program eligibility requirements. For detailed information, please refer to https://www.samsung.com/pk/trade-in/</p>
<p>20. 100x Space Zoom includes 10x optical quality zoom and 100x digital zoom with Super Resolution technology. Zoom distances past 10x zoom may express some image deterioration.</p>
<p>21. Wired transfers from Android™ devices require the receiving device to have Android™ 4.3 or later and the sending device to have Android 4.3™ or later. Transfers can be completed without a cable through a wireless connection. For wireless connections, the receiving device must have Android™ 4.0 or later and the sending device must have Android™ 4.0 or later. Open Smart Switch Mobile in “Settings” on the receiving Galaxy device or download the Smart Switch Mobile app from the Galaxy Store. Data, content and apps available for transfer may vary by transmission method.</p>
<p>22. Wired transfers from iOS require the receiving device to have Android™ 4.3 or later and the sending device to have iOS 5 or later. Transfers can be completed without a cable through a wireless connection or iCloud. For wireless connections, the receiving device must have Android™ 4.0 or later and the sending device must have iOS 12 or later. iCloud transfers require the receiving device to have Android™ 4.0 or later and the sending device to have iOS 5 or later. Open Smart Switch Mobile in “Settings” on the receiving Galaxy device or download the Smart Switch Mobile app from the Galaxy Store. For wireless transfers, download Smart Switch for iOS from the App Store on your iPhone or iPad. Data, content and apps available for transfer may vary by transmission method. Contacts, gallery, videos, calendars and reminders can be transferred wirelessly from an iOS device.</p>
<p>23. It is recommended to use a wired connection when transferring diverse sets of data at once.</p>
<p>24. Contains AI-generated images with post-editing applied.</p>

							</div>
								
						</div>
					
				</div>
			</div>	
		</div>
	
